---
// Standalone privacy page for txt2vst.com (index.astro is a standalone page,
// not layout-based, so this page ships its own shell). Fonts and jszip are
// self-hosted, so the whole site makes zero third-party requests.
const title = "Privacy & legal — txt2vst";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin:0; background:#0a0f0d; color:#d7e3de; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; line-height:1.6; font-size:16px; }
    .wrap { max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
    h1 { font-size:1.8rem; margin:0 0 .25rem; color:#fff; }
    h2 { font-size:1.15rem; margin:2.25rem 0 .5rem; color:#00d4a0; border-bottom:1px solid #17241f; padding-bottom:.3rem; }
    .lang { font-size:.7rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:2px; color:#00d4a0; margin:3rem 0 0; }
    .upd { color:#7d938b; font-size:.85rem; margin:0 0 1.5rem; }
    a { color:#00d4a0; } code { background:#12201b; padding:.1rem .35rem; border-radius:3px; font-size:.85em; }
    ul { padding-left:1.25rem; } li { margin:.35rem 0; }
    .home { display:inline-block; margin-bottom:2rem; color:#7d938b; text-decoration:none; font-size:.85rem; }
    hr { border:0; border-top:1px solid #17241f; margin:3rem 0 0; } .muted { color:#7d938b; font-size:.85rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="home" href="/">← txt2vst.com</a>
    <h1>Privacy &amp; Legal Notice</h1>
    <p class="upd">Last updated: 20 July 2026 · txt2vst.com</p>

    <p class="lang">English</p>
    <h2>Data controller</h2>
    <p><strong>Fabrizio Salmi</strong> — Genoa, Italy. txt2vst.com is the website of the open-source txt2vst project (personal, non-commercial). Contact: <a href="mailto:fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com">fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>What we process, and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Your IP and basic request data</strong> are processed transiently by our infrastructure providers to deliver the page. Legal basis: legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
      <li><strong>No analytics</strong>, no tracking pixels, no advertising.</li>
      <li><strong>No accounts, no server-side forms.</strong> Instrument generation and packaging happen in your browser.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies &amp; device storage</h2>
    <p>This site sets <strong>no cookies</strong>. Any preference the tool remembers (such as the UI theme) is stored locally on your device and never sent to us.</p>
    <h2>Third-party resources</h2>
    <p><strong>None loaded from third-party origins.</strong> Fonts, scripts, and images are served from this domain, so your browser does not fetch assets from external providers as part of normal page load. Note that our infrastructure providers (GitHub Pages and Cloudflare) still process requests to deliver the site and will receive your IP address. The web fonts (Inter and JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1) and the <code>jszip</code> library (dual-licensed MIT/GPLv3) are self-hosted copies.</p>
    <h2>Processors &amp; international transfers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>GitHub, Inc.</strong> (USA) — static hosting (GitHub Pages).</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong> (USA) — CDN, HTTPS and edge security.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Transfers to the USA are covered by the providers' DPAs and the EU–US Data Privacy Framework / Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection, portability (Arts. 15–22 GDPR) — email <a href="mailto:fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com">fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com</a>. You may complain to the <a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Garante per la protezione dei dati personali</a>. No profiling.</p>

    <p class="lang">Italiano</p>
    <h2>Titolare del trattamento</h2>
    <p><strong>Fabrizio Salmi</strong> — Genova, Italia. Sito del progetto open-source txt2vst (personale, non commerciale). Contatto: <a href="mailto:fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com">fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <h2>Dati, cookie e terze parti</h2>
    <p>IP e dati basilari della richiesta trattati in modo transitorio dall'hosting (legittimo interesse). <strong>Nessuna analitica, nessun account.</strong> Il sito <strong>non imposta cookie</strong>; eventuali preferenze (es. tema) restano sul tuo dispositivo. <strong>Nessuna risorsa di terze parti</strong>: font e librerie sono ospitati su questo dominio, quindi la semplice navigazione non comporta alcuna richiesta verso terzi.</p>
    <h2>Responsabili, trasferimenti e diritti</h2>
    <p>Responsabili: GitHub, Inc. (USA, hosting), Cloudflare, Inc. (USA, CDN). Trasferimenti verso gli USA coperti da DPA e Data Privacy Framework UE–USA / SCC. Hai i diritti degli artt. 15–22 GDPR — <a href="mailto:fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com">fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com</a> — e puoi reclamare al <a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Garante</a>. Nessuna profilazione.</p>

    <hr />
    <p class="muted">Publisher / Titolare: Fabrizio Salmi — Genoa, Italy — <a href="mailto:fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com">fabrizio.salmi@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
